R:pilot
R:@tier engine
R:@desc player walks RIGHT under injected input — the headline verification scenario
R:@level smb_w1_1-standalone.iff
R:@needs player as #P
R:@expect-exit 0
R:@expect-out PASS
R:@screenshot walk_right.png
C:#THRESH = 40.0
C:#FRAMES = 30
PS:
WA:#P X_POS
ST:8
C:#x0 = mb(X_POS, #P)
T:start X = $#x0  (need > $#THRESH)
IN:joystick1_raw BTN_RIGHT held #FRAMES
ST:30
WM:#P X_POS > #THRESH timeout 5.0
M:#last > #THRESH
SH:walk_right.png
ST:1
TY:PASS — player reached X=$#last
TN:FAIL — player stalled at X=$#last
JN:*fail
E:
*fail
EX:1
